### ============================================
### SMS VERIFICATION METHODS TESTING
### ============================================
### This file tests all SMS verification methods:
### 1. Telegram Gateway (for users with Telegram accounts)
### 2. Flash Call (for Android devices without Telegram)
### 3. Green SMS (for Russian phone numbers)
### 4. Twilio (for non-Russian phone numbers)
### ============================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:29000
@authPath = /api/v1/auth

### ============================================
### METHOD 1: TELEGRAM GATEWAY
### ============================================
### This method is used when the phone number is registered with Telegram
### The system will automatically check via Telegram Gateway API
### 
### Expected Response: verificationMethod = "Telegram Gateway"

### Test Telegram Gateway - User with Telegram Account
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Type: iOS
X-Device-Id: device-telegram-test-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890"
}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "message": "SMS verification code sent successfully",
###     "verificationMethod": "Telegram Gateway"
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### METHOD 2: FLASH CALL (Android)
### ============================================
### This method is used for Android devices when user doesn't have Telegram
### 
### Expected Response: verificationMethod = "Flash Call"

### Test Flash Call - Android Device without Telegram
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Type: Android
X-Device-Id: device-android-test-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+1987654321"
}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "message": "SMS verification code sent successfully",
###     "verificationMethod": "Flash Call"
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### METHOD 3: GREEN SMS (Russian Phone Numbers)
### ============================================
