### - User doesn't have Telegram account
### - Device is iOS or Web
### 
### Expected Response: verificationMethod = "Green SMS"

### Test Green SMS - Russian Phone Number (iOS)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Type: iOS
X-Device-Id: device-ios-russian-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+79143358022"
}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "message": "SMS verification code sent successfully",
###     "verificationMethod": "Green SMS"
###   }
### }

### Test Green SMS - Russian Phone Number (Web)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Type: Web
X-Device-Id: device-web-russian-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+79001234567"
}

