### Test Twilio - US Phone Number (iOS)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Type: iOS
X-Device-Id: device-ios-us-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+15551234567"
}

