### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "message": "SMS verification code sent successfully",
###     "verificationMethod": "Twilio"
###   }
### }

### Test Twilio - UK Phone Number (iOS)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Type: iOS
X-Device-Id: device-ios-uk-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+447911123456"
