### Test Twilio - Web Device (Non-Russian)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Type: Web
X-Device-Id: device-web-us-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+14155551234"
}

### ============================================
### FALLBACK: Request Body deviceType
### ============================================
### Testing fallback when header is not set
### Device type from request body will be used

### Test with deviceType in Request Body (Android)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Id: device-body-test-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+15559998888",
  "deviceType": "Android"
}

### Test with deviceType in Request Body (iOS)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/send-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Id: device-body-test-002

{
  "phoneNumber": "+15559998877",
  "deviceType": "iOS"
}

### ============================================
### VERIFICATION FLOW
### ============================================
### After sending SMS, verify the code

### 1. Verify SMS Code
POST {{baseUrl}}{{authPath}}/signup/verify-sms
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Id: device-verify-001

{
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "smsCode": "123456"
}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "signupToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..."
###   }
### }

### ============================================
### TESTING NOTES
### ============================================
### 
### 1. Telegram Gateway:
###    - Requires SMS_TELEGRAM_API_TOKEN to be configured
###    - System automatically checks if phone number is registered with Telegram
###    - If phone number is registered, uses Telegram Gateway
### 
### 2. Flash Call:
###    - Only used for Android devices
###    - Requires SMS_FLASHCALL_API_URL and SMS_FLASHCALL_API_KEY
###    - User receives a missed call with verification code in caller ID
### 
### 3. Green SMS:
###    - Used for Russian phone numbers (+7)
###    - Requires SMS_GREEN_JWT_TOKEN (default provided)
###    - Works for iOS and Web devices
### 
### 4. Twilio:
###    - Used for non-Russian phone numbers
###    - Requires SMS_TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID, SMS_TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN, SMS_TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER
###    - Works for iOS and Web devices
### 
### 5. Priority Order:
###    a. Check if user has Telegram account (database or API)
###    b. If Telegram → use Telegram Gateway
###    c. If no Telegram + Android → use Flash Call
###    d. If no Telegram + iOS/Web → use SMS (Green SMS for +7, Twilio for others)
### 
### 6. Device Type Priority:
###    a. X-Device-Type HTTP header (preferred)
###    b. deviceType in request body (fallback)
###    c. Default to SMS if neither provided

